<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak retail sales 5.4 pct higher yr/yr in May.</title>
<headline>Slovak retail sales 5.4 pct higher yr/yr in May.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slovak retail sales in May were 5.4 percent higher, year-on-year, after rising a real 8.0 percent annually in April, the Statistical Bureau (SUSR) said on Tuesday.</p>
<p> RETAIL SALES    May 97   April 97   May 96</p>
<p>real pct</p>
<p> change yr/yr    +5.4     +8.0	 +3.4</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 421-7-521-8402</p>
</text>
